<space dim="horizontal"/> <byline><docAuthor>Robert Casaretto</docAuthor>, <hi rendition="#g">Crefeld</hi>.</byline>               </div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div type="jAn">       <p>Hütten=Jnspector. Zum sofortigen Antritt,<lb/>
