<space dim="horizontal"/> Alois Verfell, Hammerschmied,<lb/>
<space dim="horizontal"/> <hi rendition="#g">in Chur</hi> ( Schweiz ) . </p>               </div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
